OL,3,GNEWSAWorkers put on 'light duties' as
OL,4,Acheap imported steel floods market
OL,5,
OL,6,FCheap imported steel flooding the
OL,7,Fmarket is causing lower demand and
OL,8,Fprices, companies say.
OL,10,FAndrew Gutteridge, who worked at
OL,11,FLlanwern for over 30 years, said some
OL,12,Fworkers were on lighter duties after
OL,13,Fcheap imports flooded the UK market.
OL,15,FTata Steel, which operates the works in
OL,16,FLlanwern, said the changes were having
OL,17,Fa significant impact on its business.
OL,19,FThe UK government said the measures
OL,20,Fwere introduced to strike a balance
OL,21,Fbetween protecting domestic production
OL,22,Fand maintaining a secure supply.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
